			description: ["So you want things to be fast, eh? Well you better be good at math. by attaching a large cog to a slow moving shaft we can start speeding things up, place a small cog at a diagonal to the large cog, this causes the small cog to rotate at double the &3RPM&r of the connected large cog. Place a large cog on the shaft of the small cog and connect another small cog to that large cog, and so on, up to an insane 256 &3RPM&r"]
