		{
			dependencies: ["16481BFF41FDAF0E"]
			description: ["So how we going about this? Energized Power Crushers. They are a little slow, but if you crush cobble into gravel using those crushers and then crush the gravel into sand with crushing wheels you can make a lot of sand. It is important to note however that Energized Power machines can &bINPUT&r with Funnels but they cannot &dEXPORT&r with funnels, so you will need to &celevate them slightly with a diagonal belt&r and place a hopper under the EP Crusher that hopper &dexports&r into a barrel."]
